wb-cli (1.5.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * mqtt-debug: ``source`` field is renamed to ``client_id`` everywhere —
    JSON envelope key, human-mode column header, the ``--source`` flag is
    now ``--client-id``, and the filter list in the envelope is
    ``client_id_filters`` instead of ``source_filters``. The previous name
    was misleading: this is the literal MQTT ``client_id`` mosquitto
    reports after ``Received PUBLISH from``, not a systemd unit name or
    a logical service identifier.
  * wb-cli mqtt write: now passes ``mosquitto_pub -i wb-cli-<pid>`` so
    its publishes appear in mosquitto's verbose log as
    ``wb-cli-<pid>`` instead of the opaque ``auto-<UUID>``
    mosquitto-2.0 generates for client_id-less connects. Visible
    immediately in ``mqtt-debug capture`` output.
  * Help / epilog / skill (wb-mqtt-broker) updated to use ``client_id``
    terminology and explain what mosquitto literally reports.

